A.Yn=new B.aO(A.G,A.a7,19,"B and N: Index Stretch Down","Stretch your index fingers down to B (left) and N (right).","wbb bb /bb nf ln nnn nnn nqn ndn nq nn bn ;b; nb bn rnr obo bnb bin ban bun bone bunny number never between brown bank band blank nine nobody",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","bn","Left index: B \xb7 Right index: N","B belongs to your left index finger and N to your right index finger. Now you know every letter!")
